From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mecattaf <thomas@mecattaf.dev>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:08:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: preserve native scroll distances, sources and stops

---
